      "實際功能、續航、效率及部署方式會受路線、人流、網絡、場地及配置影響，最終以正式方案及實機為準。": "Actual performance, battery life, efficiency and deployment will vary with route, foot traffic, network, site conditions and configuration. Final figures are subject to the confirmed solution and the physical unit.",
      "定時自主巡邏高風險設備區域，即時偵測異常溫度及煙火，減少人員進入危險區域的需要。": "Patrols high-risk equipment areas on a schedule, detecting abnormal heat or smoke in real time and reducing the need for staff to enter hazardous zones.",
      "配合人臉及車牌識別，24 小時不間斷監控出入口及周邊範圍，即時通報異常。": "Combined with face and license-plate recognition, it monitors entrances and surrounding areas around the clock, flagging anomalies instantly.",
      "於狹長、光線不足環境中自主巡查，透過熱成像及變焦鏡頭及早發現結構或設備異常。": "Patrols autonomously in narrow, dimly-lit environments, using thermal imaging and a zoom lens to catch structural or equipment issues early.",
      "取代人手進入樓梯、狹窄管道及高低不平的設施範圍，執行定期巡檢及異常偵測。": "Replaces manual entry into stairwells, narrow ducts and uneven facility areas to carry out scheduled inspection and anomaly detection.",
      "於行人路、斜坡及公園等混合地形穿梭，協助保安及市政人員擴大巡邏覆蓋範圍。": "Moves across mixed terrain such as footpaths, slopes and parks, helping security and municipal staff extend patrol coverage.",
      "配合鏡頭及感測模組，於人員未能安全進入的環境中先行偵察，回傳即時影像。": "Equipped with cameras and sensor modules, it scouts ahead in environments unsafe for staff and relays live footage.",
      "適合校門、停車場、貨物裝卸區等戶外及後勤範圍的日常清潔，減省人手來回搬運清潔工具的時間。": "Suited to daily cleaning of outdoor and logistics areas such as entrances, car parks and loading zones, saving staff time spent moving cleaning equipment back and forth.",
      "自主完成園區道路及大面積公共設施的例行清潔，配合定點清潔模式集中處理污漬熱點。": "Autonomously completes routine cleaning of campus roads and large public facilities, using spot-cleaning mode to focus on problem areas.",
      "支援自主搭乘電梯，可安排跨樓層的清潔路線，減少人手調動。": "Supports autonomous elevator riding, allowing cross-floor cleaning routes to be scheduled with less staff reassignment.",
      "應付高人流公共空間的大範圍地面清潔，配合環境感知系統靈活閃避行人及設施。": "Handles large-area floor cleaning in high-traffic public spaces, using its environmental sensing to navigate around pedestrians and fixtures.",
      "四合一清潔模式一次過完成擦地、掃地及除油，減少多台設備輪流作業的時間。": "Its 4-in-1 cleaning mode completes scrubbing, sweeping and degreasing in one pass, cutting down time spent rotating multiple machines.",
      "油污清潔模式專門應對廚餘或裝卸區常見的頑固油漬地面。": "Its oil-cleaning mode is built for the stubborn grease found in kitchen-waste and loading areas.",
      "統一雲端食譜，確保各分店出品口味一致，同時應付高峰時段大量點單。": "A shared cloud recipe keeps output consistent across branches while handling high order volumes at peak times.",
      "以穩定火力及翻炒技藝，複製大鑊小炒的鑊氣，減輕廚房人手短缺壓力。": "Consistent heat and wok-tossing technique reproduce authentic wok flavour, easing pressure from kitchen staff shortages.",
      "標準化出品流程，減少人為誤差，讓分店更容易複製同一水準的出品。": "Standardises the cooking process to reduce human error, making it easier for branches to replicate the same quality.",
      "應付中等單量的日常炒菜需求，降低人手成本並保持出品穩定。": "Handles day-to-day stir-frying at medium order volumes, lowering labour cost while keeping output consistent.",
      "空間有限亦可安裝，220V 電源選項省卻重新拉電的工程。": "Fits venues with limited space, and the 220V power option avoids the need for new electrical wiring.",
      "快速煮出 1–6 人份量，應付單一顧客或小量外賣訂單。": "Quickly cooks portions for 1–6 people, suited to single-customer orders or small takeaway volumes.",
      "自主搭乘電梯將毛巾、備品送到指定房間，減少房務團隊往返樓層的時間。": "Rides elevators autonomously to deliver towels and amenities to specific rooms, cutting the time housekeeping spends moving between floors.",
      "配合弧形機身及自動門設計，安全穩妥地將餐飲送達房門。": "Its curved body and automatic door design deliver food safely and securely right to the guest's door.",
      "最多支援 20 台機械人協同運作，應付大型酒店的高峰配送需求。": "Supports up to 20 robots working together, meeting peak delivery demand at large hotels.",
      "送餐同時於屏幕顯示餐廳資訊或推廣內容，一機兩用。": "Displays restaurant information or promotions on screen while delivering food, doing double duty.",
      "以大屏幕播放宣傳內容，並可引導賓客前往指定位置。": "Plays promotional content on its large screen and can guide guests to a specific location.",
      "自主頂升並運送重型醫療物資、藥物或床單等貨架，減輕護理及後勤人員負擔。": "Autonomously lifts and transports shelving loaded with heavy medical supplies, medication or linens, easing the load on nursing and logistics staff.",
      "配合層架運送活動器材、大批教材或設施用品，取代人手推車來回搬運。": "Pairs with shelving to move event equipment, bulk teaching materials or facility supplies, replacing manual trolley runs.",
      "於病房、藥房及儲物室之間運送中等重量的醫療物資，減少人手往返。": "Moves medium-weight medical supplies between wards, pharmacies and storerooms, reducing staff trips.",
